WEBVTT

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.820
It can’t be…

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.450
He’s…

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.040
…one of the Earth Clan!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.880
Akira!

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.490
What a dream…

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:45.730
This is…

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:47.550
Wha—

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.180
That’s right.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.940
That wasn’t a dream…

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:00.830
Akira.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.640
It really wasn’t a dream.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.900
Hey, Akira.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:13.300
Who am I?

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.300
Princess… Mina.

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.180
And what is your full name?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:22.180
Akira Kaburagi Regendorf.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.810
And your true identity?

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.200
A werewolf of the Earth Clan.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.100
All right!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.610
Good morning, Your Highness.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.360
Although, it’s nearly noon…

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.140
All of you are…

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.850
They’re our maids.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:42.850
Now, Nelly, Nella, and Nero. Time to get to work.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.240
As you command!

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.260
Move your hand; it’s in the way.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.260
I can do it myself!

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.140
Are you preventing me from doing my job?

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.440
Hey, Princess, please do something about this.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.130
Actually, what’s going on?!

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.520
So, does it look good on me?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.650
Hey, that outfit is…

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.620
Isn’t it obvious?

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.530
It was these actions of hers…

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.600
…that would disrupt our peaceful days.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.710
My name is Mina Țepeș.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.770
I have come here for reasons I cannot reveal.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:33.540
I hope to be able to get along with all of you.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.920
Why did it turn out like this?

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.000
It was on this very day,

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.640
that the vampires entered our academy,

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.290
and danced their way into our city.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.810
Seriously? A vampire?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.060
But why?

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.810
She’s a high school student?

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.780
W–Well then, your seat will be…

00:02:58.580 --> 00:02:59.840
Sister Laura.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:00.900
Y–Yes?

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.800
Do not be so terrified.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.830
I will not suddenly bite you.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.560
A servant of mine also resides in this class.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.540
I request that I be seated next to my servant.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.790
A servant?

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:17.380
Yes.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.380
Kaburagi Akira.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.300
Akira-kun?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.310
Sister.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:30.770
I must apologize, but I only came today to introduce myself.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.480
So please excuse me.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.650
Akira, come to the Chairman’s Office later.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:37.770
Understood?

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:39.530
Yeah, I got it.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.490
What’s all this about?

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.530
You’re the servant of a vampire?

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.000
Let us in on the details!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.510
You were just saying you weren’t interested yesterday!

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:55.570
Lay off!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.670
No, there’s no way we’re keeping quiet about this!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.670
He’s right. Tell us what’s going on!

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:09.720
Toilet.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:15.850
He ran away!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.230
Wait, Akira!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.620
That’s not fair!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.860
Saegusa, did you hear anything from Akira?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.700
No.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:28.030
This is a message from the Student Council to all committee members:

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.300
We will be holding an emergency meeting at this time.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:36.520
All officers and executive members are to report to the Student Council room.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.120
Saegusa!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:40.880
I repeat; Apart from the Student Council, all students—

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.780
Damn those guys.

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:49.140
I’m the one who wants to know what’s going on.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.640
It’s not like all of my memories have returned.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:57.640
You will turn 17 next year.

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:02.900
As ordained by our ancient covenant, you are to serve Her Royal Highness.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.030
The time draws near.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:11.780
This mission will test your worth and determine if you are fit to lead.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.490
Show us your power.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:17.120
I got it, old man.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.210
Then after that, I…

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.940
Damn, it’s still foggy.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.470
Wha—

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.640
I knew you’d be here.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.270
Y–Yo.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.550
With the exception of the Education Administration at this Academy,

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.040
all management is performed by the students, for the students.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:06:01.310
That ideal, so formed by the Chairman at the time of the Academy’s establishment, has now been trampled upon.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.790
How is it that a vampire was allowed to transfer here without any warning?

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.300
It’s unbelievable.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.920
We will confront the Chairman directly and prevent this from continuing.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.050
Confront her directly?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.430
You can’t mean that the Chairman’s actually here.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:17.560
The one who hasn’t been seen since the Academy’s establishment?

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.060
It just means there’s enough of a reason for her to show up.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.310
She must have some form of motivation.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.060
Perhaps, it's fear?

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.240
We must not be afraid, everyone.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:38.160
Right now, all of Japan is frightened by those vampires.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:43.920
We can no longer allow them to do what they want with the school that we love!

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.530
I see.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:48.460
So you’re not.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.830
Yeah, I’m not a vampire.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:55.270
Then, what are you doing with that princess?

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:59.700
Well, how should I put it? It’s something my family decided for me.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:03.670
What? You mean like an engagement or something?

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:06.980
You’ve got it wrong! It was an order from my old man.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.730
To be her servant.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.870
Akira-kun, could it be that your memory is…

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.240
Yeah.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.910
It’s still just bits and pieces.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.410
But…

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:24.160
I can remember who I am, at least.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.670
I’m…

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:35.590
Well, anyhow. I’m sorry for making you worry.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.800
No. It’s fine…

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.350
Yeah.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.230
Well, the princess is calling for me.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:47.060
I should get going.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.690
See you, Yuki.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:54.990
He’s late.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.410
I wonder if he’s still confused.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.250
A lot happened yesterday, after all.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.460
You’re right.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.180
It’s probably that.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:06.120
What’s the matter with you— Hey! Hold on!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:08.250
I wish to have a word with the Chairman.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.000
Your Highness.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.500
It’s fine. Let them in.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.130
Excuse us.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:27.780
Chairman, why did you allow a vampire to transfer here?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:31.060
I’m sorry, but may I ask for your name?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:33.230
Student Council President, Shinonome Nanami.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:37.320
Why did you allow this?! Did that monster threaten you?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.950
And that is the subject of your question, correct?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.830
That’s… correct.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.650
I see.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:48.580
Your inquiry has been received.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:53.150
That is what she asked. And what is your response, Chairman?

00:08:54.460 --> 00:09:01.260
There were no threats or intimidation involved. I created this academy so that I could attend it.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:10.520
I, Mina Țepeș, am the founder and Chairman of this academy.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.080
No way…

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:18.650
Stop joking around! Aren’t you just a kid?

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:21.280
Have you forgotten what I am?

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.440
I may have this appearance, but I am at least older than you.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.580
Who would believe such—

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.330
Wait!

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.460
That’s right.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.830
That explains everything.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:33.710
I’ve always thought it was strange.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.710
Windows made of polarized glass.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.210
A gym that’s deep underground.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.720
Everything is…

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.090
Aren’t you a smart girl?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:47.460
I have just arrived today,

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:53.510
but it appears that the students are happy and your independence has given rise to quite a splendid school.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:56.260
Words cannot express my gratitude.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:10:03.110
And with this, we now have a suitable location for the dawn of the Vampire Bund Foundation.

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:05.490
This is no joke.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:12.580
We didn’t work hard to build the Academy just so that your kind could attend, Vampire!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:18.340
It appears that you wish to become a lawyer, Shinonome Nanami.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.840
Even people’s privacy…

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.540
If you accept me as the Chairman,

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:27.350
I can give you a recommendation and provide financial aid for a university of your choice.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.600
You’re despicable.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:33.100
Sorry, but is that all you wanted to say?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:33.850
No.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.900
Then could you please wait until the afternoon?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.940
We have other plans.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:39.860
Are you running away?

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:44.360
Sorry, I’m late—

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.830
Please excuse me…

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.080
Wait, Akira.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.930
It seems that you want to chase us out no matter what.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:54.710
Yes!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.040
Then let us make a wager.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:04.800
Are you the one who gave this to me, Saegusa?

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:11.430
So does that mean that we’re…

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.670
This is Shinonome Nanami of the Student Council.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:31.910
I’m sure you are all aware that the Vampire Queen, Mina Țepeș, has just transferred into our Academy.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:35.160
We are vehemently opposed to this unreasonable act.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:40.420
And so, with the authority of the Student Council President, we order a boycott of all afternoon classes.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:44.050
Furthermore, as a result of negotiations with the Academy,

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:48.720
we have found a middle ground, and a compromise has been reached.

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:53.210
If we are successful in containing her servant, second-year student Kaburagi Akira,

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:55.280
she will no longer be allowed to attend here.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:01.480
Everyone, we must not allow a vampire to attend this school!

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:09.610
We must capture Kaburagi Akira and protect the peace of our great Academy!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:17.400
In addition, the class or club that catches him will receive extra funding.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.500
All right!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:23.380
Saijo-kun, you’re doing things just like that vampire!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.880
People won’t move unless there’s something to gain.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:28.220
It can’t be helped.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.670
It’s starting.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:40.600
Yuzuru-chan, lend me your strength.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:49.740
Geez. She’s just adding fuel to the fire.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.990
Can you do it, Akira?

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.240
I’m not going to like this, Princess.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:58.160
Did you catch a cold?

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:01.080
No, I do not catch colds.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.960
That’s good to know.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:09.230
Our meeting today should force them to allow the formation of our foundation.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.840
I have great expectations for you.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:16.880
Now, let us enter the battlefield.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:22.230
He’s not in the second corridor. The report wasn’t accurate!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.100
I got it!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.100
We’ll go around!

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:31.690
Wanted? Looks like they’ve blown this thing out of proportion.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.160
My cellphone!

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.190
Y–Yo.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.680
See you.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.460
I found him!

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:52.840
Over here, Akira!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.100
You have to escape for Mina-chan’s sake!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.440
Good luck!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:08.830
I owe you one.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:15.030
Just as expected from the capable Student Council Enforcement Group.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:16.660
Capture him!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.950
Seriously?!

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:26.170
We desire but one thing from you.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:34.970
I would like to present the information Isurugi’s faction has provided us regarding our special foundation.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:40.480
Well, if things could be solved without education and talent,

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.860
we would not have needed to come as far as Japan.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.530
Vera, show them <i>that</i>.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.230
As you wish.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.650
First, take a look at this.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:51.520
The conversation will follow.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:53.360
Th–This is…

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.870
Is this the truth?!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.870
This is…

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.360
It is the truth.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.040
What are your thoughts?

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.410
I can’t believe this!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.790
Why are they so persistent?!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.710
For my club!

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.960
Damn it! So it’s all about money in the end?!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.960
Precisely!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:19.930
If you do not accept the existence of the Bund Foundation, we will withdraw our holding.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.810
I want to see what you’re trying to accomplish by force.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.810
Please wait! That would be disastrous!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.640
Unquestionably.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:29.480
I set this up to achieve that kind of result.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:35.080
Your Majesty, we are very sorry, but we cannot accept this at the moment.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.740
Let us continue this in the afternoon after looking over the data—

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.740
How naïve.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.200
You are all far too naïve.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.700
Even if you try to run from it, the situation will not change.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.540
Rather, you will just lose your composure,

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:53.290
as you are pushed into a corner by this inconvenient truth.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.800
There’s no way out.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:16:01.550
Consider this the only way for your country to survive.

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.300
Just give up already!

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:10.440
Will you accept our proposal, or would you rather delve further into the pits of hell?

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.130
He disappeared.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.750
Damn it!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:38.800
Geez.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.430
Just as I had expected, Akira.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:50.680
D–Did you see that?

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:56.270
So it really is true that you lost your memories.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:01.000
But you’re so sexy when you sweat!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:06.780
Hey, does your work with the princess continue on through the night?

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:09.040
Idiot, what are you—

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.410
Then what’s this?

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:19.300
I left you my address, so call me whenever you feel like it.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:27.680
Meiren?

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.150
I’m so exhausted.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:41.900
Well done, Akira.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.940
Seriously.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.300
How about you?

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:50.910
Too easy. Our Student Council has much more backbone than they do.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.040
Well? How are you feeling?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.960
Has your memory returned?

00:17:56.960 --> 00:18:01.460
No. It’s all in pieces and I can’t understand anything.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.900
Then the promise seven years ago…

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.430
Promise? What are you talking about?

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.680
I see… It cannot be helped…

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.060
You just started regaining your memory.

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:25.350
So as time passes, you may be able to remember more.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:29.320
Yes. You’ve always been carefree like that—

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.830
Just kidding!

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:35.080
A–Are you mocking me?!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.330
Ow, that hurts! I’m sorry, I’m sorry!

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:46.470
You did well in returning, Akira.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.120
Princess.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.970
The President’s really working hard.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.980
Sorry about today.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:03.610
It’s fine. I’m sure you’re shocked about Akira being a vampire’s servant, too.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.490
I think about it even now.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:13.990
I was thinking only of Akira-kun at that time.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:17.500
I had no time to worry about other things.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:22.500
But if I had gone home with the President back then,

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:27.340
how would that have changed her fate?

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:30.070
I somehow managed to get through the day,

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:33.790
but school will probably just get worse from here on out.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.220
Don’t worry. I have a plan.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.730
Hey, Princess.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:44.730
Why are you going to school at such an important time?

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.780
What do you want to do?

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.290
It does not concern you.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.000
No!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.380
Dance with the Vampire Maids.

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.590
Part Three!

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:11.550
Wait!

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.680
Special Momentum!

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.090
You guys are being too unsightly!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.840
I’m going to torture him with water!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:20.430
Since I feel like doing something, I’m going to poison him.

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:22.390
Too slow.

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:24.840
Then I’ll use poison darts.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.680
Why are you stuck on poison? Try to be more flashy!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.190
An earth-shattering bomb!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.690
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.190
You’re saying that <i>now</i>?

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.450
Right?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:36.070
What do you mean “right?”
